        "## QUESTION|TASK 2\n",
        "\n",
        "__Recreate the example charts from [PY4DS: CH2 Data Visualization](https://aeturrell.github.io/python4DS/data-visualise.html) of the textbook. (Hint: copy the chart code from 2.2.3. Creating a plot, one plot for each cell below)__\n"
      ],
      "id": "9dbc0937"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "# Include and execute your code here\n",
        "(\n",
        "    ggplot(data=penguins, mapping=aes(x=\"flipper_length_mm\", y=\"body_mass_g\"))\n",
        "    + geom_point()\n",
        ")\n"
      ],
      "id": "8de89c4a",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "_include figures in chunks and discuss your findings in the figure._"
      ],
      "id": "ac4ecaac"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "# Include and execute your code here\n",
        "(\n",
        "    ggplot(\n",
        "        data=penguins,\n",
        "        mapping=aes(x=\"flipper_length_mm\", y=\"body_mass_g\", color=\"species\"),\n",
        "    )\n",
        "    + geom_point()\n",
        ")"
      ],
      "id": "ca004017",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "# Include and execute your code here\n",
        "(\n",
        "    ggplot(\n",
        "        data=penguins,\n",
        "        mapping=aes(x=\"flipper_length_mm\", y=\"body_mass_g\", color=\"species\"),\n",
        "    )\n",
        "    + geom_point()\n",
        "    + geom_smooth(method=\"lm\")\n",
        ")"
      ],
      "id": "18fd07ae",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "# Include and execute your code here\n",
        "(\n",
        "    ggplot(data=penguins, mapping=aes(x=\"flipper_length_mm\", y=\"body_mass_g\"))\n",
        "    + geom_point(mapping=aes(color=\"species\"))\n",
        "    + geom_smooth(method=\"lm\")\n",
        ")\n"
      ],
      "id": "e79f1a38",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "# Include and execute your code here\n",
        "(\n",
        "    ggplot(data=penguins, mapping=aes(x=\"flipper_length_mm\", y=\"body_mass_g\"))\n",
        "    + geom_point(aes(color=\"species\", shape=\"species\"))\n",
        "    + geom_smooth(method=\"lm\")\n",
        "    + labs(\n",
        "        title=\"Body mass and flipper length\",\n",
        "        subtitle=\"Dimensions for Adelie, Chinstrap, and Gentoo Penguins\",\n",
        "        x=\"Flipper length (mm)\",\n",
        "        y=\"Body mass (g)\",\n",
        "        color=\"Species\",\n",
        "        shape=\"Species\",\n",
        "    )\n",
        ")"
      ],
      "id": "215ad360",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
